WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.160
Life in the future could be very different to life today.

2
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.120
Imagine if you’ve got a time capsule

3
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.320
with everyday objects

4
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.240
then buried it for a hundred years.

5
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.080
What would you put in the time capsule

6
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.560
to show people of the future what life is like today?

7
00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.320
I’d put in a computer mouse

8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.640
because I don’t think they’d need it in a hundred years

9
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.400
because everything will be touchscreen.

10
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.160
I’d put a remote control

11
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.200
because they’ll probably l be all eye-control in the future.

12
00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.240
Also, I’d put 3D glasses in

13
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.160
because cinemas won’t use them anymore.

14
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.200
Great.

15
00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.840
I would put in a CD of music from today

16
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.240
and a letter about my school.

17
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:49.160
Great.

18
00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:52.120
I’d put in a newspaper from today

19
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.800
to show people what life is like today.
